OL,3,GNEWSA'Fantastic' moment blind veteran,
OL,4,A95, drives again after giving up
OL,5,Alicence
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 95 year-old veteran has spoken of his
OL,8,Fjoy at driving again, five years after
OL,9,Fhe was registered blind and had to give
OL,10,Fup his licence.
OL,12,FJim Alison, from Abergavenny, raced
OL,13,Faround Llandow Circuit in the Vale of
OL,14,Fthe Glamorgan as part of a charity
OL,15,Fevent which helps people with
OL,16,Fdisabilities to experience driving.
OL,18,F"I think I managed to get to 90 km/ph
OL,19,F(55mph)," said Jim, a former chauffeur,
OL,20,Fwho drove alongside an instructor with
OL,21,Fdual controls.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
