OL,3,GNEWSA'Fantastic' moment blind veteran,
OL,4,A95, drives again after giving up
OL,5,Alicence
OL,6,
OL,7,F"You put your life in their hands and
OL,8,Fit was absolutely fantastic," added
OL,9,FJim, who served with the Royal
OL,10,FEngineers for 22 years before becoming
OL,11,Fa driver in London.
